WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.435
[Translation Notes]


00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:09.204
Time: Sengoku Era (~1493 - 1598), 
a time when Japan was
divided into manywarring provinces
each ruled by a feudal lord.


00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:14.470
Location: Akaike, a small and poor 
province bythe sea.


00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:20.284
Other: Ming Dynasty/Ming, refers to China 
which was ruled bythe Ming atthe time.


00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.148
Shouan!


00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:57.887
Don't worry.


00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.683
If we've come this far, 
we should be safe.


00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:02.128
Listen up Kotarou,


00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.820
You need to go on alone from 
here on out.


00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:04.352
What?


00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.490
If something happens along 
the way,


00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.160
Sell this for money.


00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:09.995
What about you, Shouan!?


00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:13.062
I need to check if everyone at 
the temple is safe.


00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:14.705
In Akeike,


00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:16.809
Head forthe Mangaku Temple in Shirato.


00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.841
Monk Zekkai will help you.


00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:19.544
But..!


00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:20.839
Hurry up and go!


00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:21.772
Hurry!


00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.454
Once we pass this mountain, 
you'll reach our province.


00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:10.659
The footing's bad, so from here 
on out we'll go by foot.


00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:28.579
How aboutt his?


00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.006
Got it!


00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.551
It's finally time to shine!


00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:31.951
Put me in too!
It's finally time to shine!


00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:32.318
Put me in too!


00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:32.952
Put me in too!
Hope you don't lose it all!


00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:33.884
Hope you don't lose it all!


00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.711
Idiot!


00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:39.089
You've drank too much, 
you're red as rooster.


00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:55.739
Boss!


00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:56.576
We 've got some prey!


00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:59.340
...  
.


00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:20.361
.


00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:22.690
What's the matt-


00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.773
Release the arrows!


00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:38.879
. .


00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:51.286
Doshi, Kachuu, the crates!


00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:59.233
.


00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.474
Keep shooting! Keep shooting!


00:04:22.629 --> 00:04:26.759
Against those numbers, 
Lord Rarou alone is enough.


00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.930
.


00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:42.977
. . .
.  .


00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:57.827
Die!


00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:12.306
.


00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:15.737
It h u rts!


00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:17.316
It hurts!


00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.284
It hurts! It hurts!


00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:23.287
It hurts!!


00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:28.956
.


00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:52.808
You bastard!!!!


00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:09.893
Both crates are safe.


00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:20.569
Is this the level of swordsmen 
in this country?


00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:23.777
.


00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:33.115
Akaike province


00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.279
Hey!!


00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.424
You shitty dog, get out!


00:07:07.627 --> 00:07:09.652
Shit! I'm gonna beat you to death!


00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:11.355
Wait!!!!!


00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:21.098
Tobimaru,


00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.699
We're eating well tonight!


00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.598
Justwait a second.


00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:43.149
After we eat, we're leaving 
this village, ok?


00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:44.918
...ok?


00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.189
Who's there?!


00:08:56.669 --> 00:08:59.502
Not anyone suspicious, don't worry.


00:08:59.672 --> 00:09:00.866
Get out!


00:09:05.177 --> 00:09:06.804
When you say "get out",


00:09:07.747 --> 00:09:09.271
Does that means this is your


00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.717
home?


00:09:11.984 --> 00:09:14.214
That's right!  This is our home!


00:09:14.554 --> 00:09:17.546
We've been here looong 
beforeyou came!


00:09:18.858 --> 00:09:21.190
Well then I'll rent myself this space.


00:09:24.964 --> 00:09:26.329
Tobimaru, let's go!


00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:33.802
Is that a fish I smell?


00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:34.804
Tobimaru!


00:09:46.586 --> 00:09:48.816
I'm chilled to the bone.


00:09:48.988 --> 00:09:51.456
Give it an hour and it 
should calm down.


00:09:51.524 --> 00:09:53.651
It sure is cold.


00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:56.659
To think we'd be escorting 
these Ming.


00:09:58.331 --> 00:10:00.128
Even I have my limits.


00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:06.904
Letting strangers likethat into the castle,
what could the lord bethinking?


00:10:07.139 --> 00:10:10.540
The lord must have some plan.


00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:12.710
Talking about strange,


00:10:12.845 --> 00:10:15.211
They're building something over 
at the Shishine Fortress.


00:10:16.315 --> 00:10:16.940
Oh,


00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.781
You mean that old fortress in
the mountains?


00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:26.123
I hearthey searched the entire province
and decided on the Shishine Fortress.


00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:28.626
Probably something to do with 
the foundation.


00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:33.695
I heard they hired a lot of workers 
and started barking orders.


00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:38.565
What arethey doing out in that place?


00:10:38.771 --> 00:10:43.606
There's no waywe could know 
how people from Ming think.


00:10:55.154 --> 00:10:56.678
That's a nice smell.


00:10:57.056 --> 00:10:58.489
It's ourfish.


00:10:58.991 --> 00:11:02.154
I'll let you know that I don't have 
a single fish for you.


00:11:03.629 --> 00:11:06.928
You haven't been living here all 
that long, right?


00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:11.369
Smoke coming up like that is a 
sign of an unused tree.


00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:13.767
You need to dry it first.


00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.434
I don't need your advice!


00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:18.905
Be careful, it's hot.


00:11:29.388 --> 00:11:30.582
I'm eating it.


00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.848
Do what you like!


00:11:32.224 --> 00:11:33.851
I didn't say it to you.


00:11:35.895 --> 00:11:37.192
I said it to the dog.


00:11:57.316 --> 00:12:01.480
Oh Yes, I did see a young child run by.


00:12:01.954 --> 00:12:02.921
Was he alone?


00:12:03.422 --> 00:12:05.720
I think he had a dog was it?


00:12:06.325 --> 00:12:08.122
When did you see him?


00:12:08.494 --> 00:12:10.792
It might 've been this morning...


00:12:11.163 --> 00:12:12.562
Where?


00:12:13.666 --> 00:12:17.432
I've been getting bad at 
remembering things these days...


00:12:17.937 --> 00:12:20.132
No matterwhat, you have to remember!


00:12:20.406 --> 00:12:23.170
Even if you saythat...


00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:27.040
You remembered?!


00:12:34.019 --> 00:12:38.217
Hmm...I didn't think there was 
anyone living in that temple.


00:12:46.198 --> 00:12:47.495
Tobimaru, run!


00:13:04.984 --> 00:13:07.475
We are the lord's army.


00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.516
Don't interfere!


00:13:12.992 --> 00:13:16.018
Don't you think this is a bit rough 
for a kid?


00:13:16.862 --> 00:13:17.829
Move!


00:13:20.432 --> 00:13:21.990
Bastard!!


00:13:22.134 --> 00:13:24.034
Do you not understand what I'm saying?!!


00:13:24.336 --> 00:13:25.132
Don't draw it.


00:13:25.938 --> 00:13:26.996
Watch whatyou say!


00:13:48.594 --> 00:13:51.495
Sorry, but I don't plan on getting 
any further involved in this.


00:14:12.718 --> 00:14:13.514
Tobimaru!


00:15:02.167 --> 00:15:03.065
Tobimaru!


00:15:03.702 --> 00:15:04.532
Tobimaru.


00:15:07.539 --> 00:15:08.506
Seems poisoned.


00:15:11.043 --> 00:15:12.806
It's not something an amateur can cure.


00:15:13.679 --> 00:15:15.476
Though if you take him to a doctor,


00:15:15.781 --> 00:15:17.214
Where's a doctor?


00:15:17.249 --> 00:15:18.580
Ask in thevillage.


00:15:19.752 --> 00:15:21.413
If I go back I'll be captured.


00:15:23.455 --> 00:15:25.650
Then you'll have to ride a horse 
to the next village.


00:15:26.258 --> 00:15:27.725
I can't ride a horse.


00:15:27.826 --> 00:15:30.818
Well then good luck on nursing him.


00:15:32.097 --> 00:15:34.691
I guess the dead won't be needing this.


00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.365
You plan on leaving?!


00:15:36.435 --> 00:15:39.734
You think I could live long in 
a violent place like this?


00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.830
It's your fault!


00:15:43.108 --> 00:15:45.804
Tobimaru's dying because of you!


00:15:46.145 --> 00:15:48.579
He saved your life and you're going 
to leave him!!?


00:15:48.681 --> 00:15:49.739
Have you no shame!


00:15:50.082 --> 00:15:51.982
And I'm the one who saved you!


00:15:52.251 --> 00:15:53.377
We're even.


00:16:01.727 --> 00:16:03.752
If you plan on living alone,


00:16:04.029 --> 00:16:05.963
Then don't depend on others.


00:16:13.539 --> 00:16:14.733
Wait!


00:16:18.911 --> 00:16:20.538
A...a deal!


00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:22.509
If you save Tobimaru,


00:16:22.581 --> 00:16:26.415
And take us to the Mangaku Temple
in Shirato, I'll give you this!


00:16:26.819 --> 00:16:28.514
It's worth ten ryo if you sell it!


00:16:28.921 --> 00:16:29.910
Ten ryo?


00:16:29.989 --> 00:16:32.355
That's right, ten ryo!


00:16:43.869 --> 00:16:45.393
Well it doesn't look cheap.


00:16:45.738 --> 00:16:46.830
Of course!


00:16:47.039 --> 00:16:50.008
I've never told a lie!


00:16:51.243 --> 00:16:52.733
You can't come any closer.


00:16:52.845 --> 00:16:55.871
It'd be trouble if you ran when 
I gave it to you.


00:16:56.115 --> 00:16:58.083
If you take us, I'll give it to you.


00:16:58.283 --> 00:16:59.147
What will you do?


00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:00.986
Shirato, eh?


00:17:01.987 --> 00:17:03.579
It is a bit far...


00:17:03.655 --> 00:17:05.384
You don't want ten ryo?


00:17:07.993 --> 00:17:09.483
Well it is ten ryo...


00:17:11.063 --> 00:17:12.530
Don't you want it!?


00:17:14.767 --> 00:17:16.462
Don't you want it!?


00:17:16.802 --> 00:17:18.463
Don't you want it?!


00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:29.674
Is Tobimaru ok?


00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.149
Is the town far?


00:17:35.821 --> 00:17:38.551
Answer me! I'm your boss!


00:17:39.792 --> 00:17:42.260
The dog's in pain, but he's still breathing.


00:17:43.128 --> 00:17:44.993
It'll still be a while until the town.


00:17:45.397 --> 00:17:46.557
Hurry up!


00:17:46.799 --> 00:17:48.027
The horse is exhausted.


00:17:48.267 --> 00:17:53.227
Plus even if there's a doctor, we
don't know if he'll look at a dog.


00:17:56.542 --> 00:17:57.133
Hey,


00:17:57.509 --> 00:17:59.602
Why are you being chased?


00:17:59.978 --> 00:18:02.538
If I'm working for you, you should 
be able to tell me.


00:18:03.916 --> 00:18:05.907
If Tobimaru dies, it's your fault!


00:18:06.185 --> 00:18:07.675
I won't give you the treasure!


00:18:07.786 --> 00:18:09.083
I'll never forgiveyou!


00:18:09.354 --> 00:18:10.981
I'll curse you until I'm dead!


00:18:12.958 --> 00:18:14.619
What a boss.


00:18:32.678 --> 00:18:35.476
He says to hire more workers and 
hurry the construction.


00:18:35.981 --> 00:18:37.073
Understood.


00:18:37.549 --> 00:18:44.921
First they give gold for the land and workers,
and now a hundred ryo for more workers...


00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:48.457
None of it seems to make any sense.


00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:52.787
I'm sure they have a reason to hurry,
but even if we ask they won't tell us.


00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:58.997
It's probably got something to do
with the kid they're chasing.


00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:04.374
Still, the more they keep it a secret 
the more I want to know.


00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:05.701
Indeed.


00:19:06.111 --> 00:19:10.844
But when they're vessels of the Ming
Dynasty, it's tough to lay a hand.


00:19:17.456 --> 00:19:21.153
Hide the saddle. It sticks out because 
of the odd shape.


00:19:22.161 --> 00:19:24.288
You should 've just bought a samurai horse.


00:19:24.963 --> 00:19:27.022
I just bought the best one.


00:19:27.666 --> 00:19:28.928
You hide it!


00:19:29.601 --> 00:19:31.762
Bring the horse after you've hid 
the saddle.


00:19:32.404 --> 00:19:34.531
If you take too long you'll get lost.


00:19:36.508 --> 00:19:37.304
Shit!


00:19:43.615 --> 00:19:45.981
I've done what I can, but...


00:19:46.451 --> 00:19:49.579
I've never worked on an animal before.


00:19:56.995 --> 00:19:57.927
Tobimaru!


00:20:03.769 --> 00:20:05.168
Will he be ok?


00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.965
The wound isn't bad,


00:20:07.239 --> 00:20:08.968
But the poison got into his body.


00:20:09.741 --> 00:20:12.505
Anyhow, the doctor said to make sure
he drinks water and doesn't move.


00:20:13.011 --> 00:20:13.500
Water?


00:20:14.246 --> 00:20:15.645
It'll drive away the poison.


00:20:20.719 --> 00:20:21.344
Shit!


00:20:21.787 --> 00:20:23.755
It's not going to work while he's paralyzed.


00:20:24.423 --> 00:20:25.685
Put Tobimaru down.


00:20:26.024 --> 00:20:27.150
I said put him down!


00:21:00.459 --> 00:21:02.324
Did anyone see anything?


00:21:02.461 --> 00:21:09.890
Unfortunately, the villager who led them here
seperated from the group before they entered.


00:21:10.135 --> 00:21:10.863
I see.


00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:31.018
What do you mean by this?


00:21:46.738 --> 00:21:48.535
Was there a festival tonight?


00:21:52.878 --> 00:21:57.747
If you want, you can stay in the back.
It's empty so it should be comfortable.


00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.076
Thanks.


00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:03.781
Well I've got your money, 
so I don't mind.


00:22:03.989 --> 00:22:10.417
Oh yeah, there's an bath on the cliff just a little
walk from here. Take a dip if you feel like it.


00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:39.623
Looks like I overslept.


00:22:42.961 --> 00:22:45.930
How's the little dog?


00:22:52.003 --> 00:22:53.436
Where are you going!?


00:22:53.905 --> 00:22:55.873
I'm going to town to get a saddle.


00:22:56.308 --> 00:22:59.141
Saying something like that, you
aren't planning on running are you?


00:23:00.412 --> 00:23:03.074
If did that, I'd have done all this 
work for free.


00:23:32.911 --> 00:23:35.641
Is that him? 
The blond haired monster?


00:23:36.214 --> 00:23:40.173
Yeah, I hear he's a guest and has been
going in and out of the lord's castle.


00:23:40.318 --> 00:23:43.515
And I hear his eyes are blue!


00:23:43.622 --> 00:23:44.987
Is that true?


00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:46.049
Yeah.


00:23:50.529 --> 00:23:55.432
I heart hat blue eyed guy has 
a lot of gold,


00:23:55.567 --> 00:23:59.094
Better not get too close though, 
or he'll eat you!


00:23:59.471 --> 00:24:00.836
Ain't that right.


00:24:01.373 --> 00:24:02.840
Is something like this good?


00:24:04.643 --> 00:24:06.941
That's a saddle from Ooatari...


00:24:07.712 --> 00:24:10.772
I brought a bunch when I moved here.


00:24:11.249 --> 00:24:13.581
Who'd want to stay in that 
ruined province.


00:24:14.019 --> 00:24:14.951
Yeah...


00:24:15.387 --> 00:24:17.116
Don't let it bother you.


00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:25.325
Kingai and Doshi haven't returned 
from the search yesterday.


00:24:26.164 --> 00:24:27.722
They probably found a lead.


00:24:28.200 --> 00:24:30.930
I doubt anything could have happened 
to those two.


00:24:40.445 --> 00:24:44.779
Still, I never would have thought finding
a child would take so much effort.


00:24:45.383 --> 00:24:48.113
Indeed, we only have four days left.


00:24:49.054 --> 00:24:50.988
Eventually he'll come to the temple, but...


00:24:51.089 --> 00:24:55.150
If we miss this full moon, we'll have to
spend another year in this country.


00:24:56.361 --> 00:24:58.625
I'm tired of this country already.


00:25:00.499 --> 00:25:03.559
But since it's for the senyaku, 
it can't be helped.


00:25:04.402 --> 00:25:05.562
Senyaku...


00:25:06.505 --> 00:25:09.167
I can only think of it as one big joke.


00:25:09.808 --> 00:25:13.437
Do you not use our drug because
you do not believe in the senyaku?


00:25:13.745 --> 00:25:15.235
That's not the problem.


00:25:15.514 --> 00:25:19.075
The drugs you guys take at least work.


00:25:19.651 --> 00:25:21.209
But senyaku...


00:25:21.887 --> 00:25:24.253
That's something that even I cannot know.


00:25:25.023 --> 00:25:29.483
Wait, then why don't you use our drug?


00:25:30.462 --> 00:25:32.020
Because it's boring.


00:25:49.014 --> 00:25:50.413
What's wrong?


00:25:52.484 --> 00:25:54.714
I feel...Iike having a little fun.


00:27:13.198 --> 00:27:15.428
Why don't you draw?


00:27:16.468 --> 00:27:19.460
Is your blade a fake?


00:27:35.487 --> 00:27:36.511
Lord Rarou!


00:27:39.991 --> 00:27:41.151
What is it?


00:27:41.459 --> 00:27:43.359
Kingai and Doshi have been killed!


00:27:48.266 --> 00:27:50.325
...and it was just getting fun.


00:28:25.136 --> 00:28:26.501
You sure are late.


00:28:26.771 --> 00:28:27.499
Really?


00:28:28.206 --> 00:28:31.198
Sure you weren't looking to sell me out?


00:28:31.509 --> 00:28:34.103
Who'd buy a twisted kid like you?


00:28:34.646 --> 00:28:35.635
Don't play dumb!


00:28:37.048 --> 00:28:40.506
You were trying to find out why
I'm being chased, weren't you?


00:28:40.785 --> 00:28:43.549
I bet you were asking all around town!


00:28:43.788 --> 00:28:45.881
Brat, shut up already.


00:28:46.491 --> 00:28:48.356
I'm not "brat", I'm Kotarou!


00:28:48.660 --> 00:28:50.150
What are you hiding from me?!


00:28:51.096 --> 00:28:54.122
Finding someone to sell me a saddle
took sometime.


00:28:55.300 --> 00:28:57.359
That sounds like a big lie!


00:28:57.569 --> 00:28:59.161
What do I have to say to make 
you believe me?


00:28:59.437 --> 00:29:01.632
Who trusts a man who works for money?!


00:29:01.840 --> 00:29:04.365
I hope you fall on your money!


00:29:05.944 --> 00:29:07.707
If you're going to go that far,


00:29:08.279 --> 00:29:09.644
Then should we part ways here?


00:29:10.014 --> 00:29:13.177
If you do that, you'll have done all 
this work for free, right?


00:29:22.193 --> 00:29:23.125
Tobimaru!


00:29:23.361 --> 00:29:24.328
Tobimaru!


00:29:29.868 --> 00:29:31.301
Don't rush,


00:29:31.436 --> 00:29:32.960
Drink nice and slow.


00:29:38.743 --> 00:29:40.267
The doctor gave me this.


00:29:41.079 --> 00:29:43.912
"when he gets to the point where he
can drink water, he should drink this"


00:29:44.449 --> 00:29:47.009
He said it tastes real bad so he'll 
probably give a fight.


00:29:48.887 --> 00:29:50.855
I'll make dinner.


00:29:57.162 --> 00:29:59.630
Wait, I'll help you drink it.


00:30:11.676 --> 00:30:15.339
The clothes and sword are Doshi's, 
but it's someone else.


00:30:15.713 --> 00:30:19.149
Doshi had an old scar on his right 
arm down to the bone.


00:30:19.584 --> 00:30:23.042
There was no scar on the burned corpse?


00:30:23.621 --> 00:30:26.590
There were also several other things off.


00:30:27.158 --> 00:30:32.221
Going by the corpse conditions, 
the first to die were Kingai and two 
soldiers of this province.


00:30:32.530 --> 00:30:35.397
Kingai died by having his entire
neck shattered with a single blow.


00:30:35.667 --> 00:30:37.635
It must have been someone skilled.


00:30:37.969 --> 00:30:41.234
Looking at the wounds on the rest of
the corpses, it seems Doshi killed them.


00:30:41.506 --> 00:30:43.701
Kingai's hair was cut, but...


00:30:44.209 --> 00:30:46.973
I believe Doshi was the one who did it.


00:30:47.245 --> 00:30:51.375
Are you saying Doshi was attacked
by the soldiers of this province?


00:30:51.649 --> 00:30:52.673
Likely.


00:30:53.384 --> 00:30:54.986
Then Doshi....


00:30:54.986 --> 00:30:59.480
Since they made it seem like he died,
it means he's likely alive somewhere.


00:31:01.793 --> 00:31:04.455
It's become troublesome, hasn't it?


00:31:28.953 --> 00:31:30.011
I'm sorry.


00:31:31.923 --> 00:31:33.948
I'm sorry...for before.


00:31:34.859 --> 00:31:36.918
I...Iost my temper.


00:31:38.863 --> 00:31:40.797
We both did.


00:31:41.132 --> 00:31:42.793
Don't worry about it.


00:31:47.472 --> 00:31:49.633
I'm a little impatient,


00:31:49.841 --> 00:31:52.173
From now on don't make me wait too long.


00:32:28.980 --> 00:32:29.844
That's...?


00:32:30.014 --> 00:32:32.539
It sounds like it's from the west wing...


00:32:32.850 --> 00:32:37.514
I heard the guests were trying out
a gift that was brought for them.


00:32:37.922 --> 00:32:39.253
A terrible sound...


00:32:40.358 --> 00:32:42.019
I sense an ill-omen.


00:32:51.569 --> 00:32:53.901
What kind of charm is that?


00:32:54.839 --> 00:32:57.239
It makes it so you can't draw the sword, right?


00:33:00.812 --> 00:33:03.181
It's like a prayer type thing.


00:33:03.181 --> 00:33:04.816
What kind of prayer?


00:33:04.816 --> 00:33:06.681
It's a secret to others.


00:33:07.452 --> 00:33:09.647
Hmph, getting me all interested.


00:33:16.494 --> 00:33:17.153
Good, good.


00:33:17.495 --> 00:33:19.986
You're really nice to horses.


00:33:22.367 --> 00:33:25.768
What benefit is there to having a horse in a good mood?


00:33:25.970 --> 00:33:27.301
There's lots.


00:33:27.805 --> 00:33:30.968
Like making him quiet so you can sneak up and rob people?


00:33:31.309 --> 00:33:33.971
If you learn to ride a horse you'll understand.


00:33:34.178 --> 00:33:36.339
If you ride a horse, you feel good.


00:33:37.048 --> 00:33:39.778
When you're on a horse running at full speed,


00:33:39.984 --> 00:33:41.781
How do I say it...


00:33:42.053 --> 00:33:42.849
Yeah,


00:33:43.121 --> 00:33:45.282
It's like you're flying in the skies.


00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:46.954
The sky?


00:33:47.291 --> 00:33:49.555
That ain't a bad feeling.


00:33:51.195 --> 00:33:54.323
You feel a nice wind in your chest.


00:33:54.565 --> 00:33:55.793
And that's when you feel,


00:33:56.567 --> 00:33:59.434
Just a bit more free than you are now.


00:34:02.774 --> 00:34:03.798
Really?


00:34:08.780 --> 00:34:12.716
Does it really feel nice like you're flying in the sky?


00:34:18.089 --> 00:34:21.490
Whether it does or not, that's something
for you to find out for yourself.


00:34:42.713 --> 00:34:43.907
Owww.


00:34:44.549 --> 00:34:46.039
It's because you're swaying.


00:34:46.117 --> 00:34:49.609
It's not my fault. It's because this horse is rough!


00:34:49.887 --> 00:34:50.945
How's he rough?


00:34:51.089 --> 00:34:52.750
He's extremely calm.


00:34:52.857 --> 00:34:55.621
Look, he's been neutered.


00:34:57.228 --> 00:34:59.219
It's to make him calm.


00:34:59.831 --> 00:35:02.026
What do you want to do? Quit already?


00:35:24.555 --> 00:35:29.015
It didn't seem like they suspected us.


00:35:29.193 --> 00:35:30.683
Don't let your guard down.


00:35:30.728 --> 00:35:33.196
You've always been too cautious.


00:35:33.264 --> 00:35:34.322
What results do you have?


00:35:34.432 --> 00:35:37.094
I've never seen a man with endurance like this.


00:35:37.235 --> 00:35:40.204
No matter how many times he's
burned he doesn't bat an eyebrow.


00:35:42.773 --> 00:35:44.240
Let me see.


00:35:54.018 --> 00:35:56.987
Oh! This is unbelievable!


00:35:57.655 --> 00:35:59.384
What do you think, Shougen?


00:35:59.557 --> 00:36:02.321
Even if we speak different words, we are all human.


00:36:02.560 --> 00:36:07.930
To not feel pain. Even before my eyes it seems unbelievable.


00:36:08.065 --> 00:36:11.967
Lord! Please leave the interrogation to me.


00:36:12.370 --> 00:36:14.668
Yes, you are a dependable man.


00:36:14.872 --> 00:36:17.363
Itadori Shougen, I'm leaving it to you.


00:36:17.508 --> 00:36:22.468
Interrogate this Ming and make some sort of deal with him.


00:36:26.417 --> 00:36:29.716
Oh Mr. Samurai, you sure are up early.


00:36:29.954 --> 00:36:30.852
You as well.


00:36:30.922 --> 00:36:34.881
I was thinking about going down to town.


00:36:34.992 --> 00:36:37.995
If I could sell these crops for a high price, it'd be great.


00:36:37.995 --> 00:36:43.092
I've always wanted to raise a fortune rather than raise crops...


00:37:03.187 --> 00:37:05.212
Are you cooking cow shit or something?!


00:37:05.756 --> 00:37:07.280
It's from the berries.


00:37:08.059 --> 00:37:10.254
If it cooks a little longer the smell will go away.


00:37:10.895 --> 00:37:13.887
Are you trying to kill me so you can steal the treasure?


00:37:15.633 --> 00:37:16.622
Seriously...


00:37:17.235 --> 00:37:19.396
A bad boss sure makes you work.


00:37:20.671 --> 00:37:23.003
I'll give you twenty mon for all of it.


00:37:23.074 --> 00:37:25.235
How about just a little bit more?


00:37:25.276 --> 00:37:26.766
No, no.


00:37:26.911 --> 00:37:29.971
If you don't like it, you can try somewhere else.


00:37:39.824 --> 00:37:42.156
What's it say?


00:37:42.526 --> 00:37:46.189
The lord is looking for a kid with a dog.


00:37:46.731 --> 00:37:50.189
There's a huge reward to the one who finds him.


00:37:50.534 --> 00:37:52.764
A kid with a dog, eh?


00:37:52.903 --> 00:37:55.463
There are thousands of those around here,


00:37:55.573 --> 00:37:57.666
Don't waste your time on this!


00:38:03.547 --> 00:38:04.070
Hey,


00:38:06.350 --> 00:38:09.046
These strangers think they can just waltz around the castle.


00:38:12.290 --> 00:38:14.315
I...I've lost.


00:38:14.859 --> 00:38:17.760
You're still too weak to draw a bow.


00:38:18.129 --> 00:38:18.788
Next!


00:38:18.896 --> 00:38:19.988
Yes!


00:38:44.021 --> 00:38:46.956
Sorry about that, my hand slipped from the sweat.


00:38:47.391 --> 00:38:50.451
How about it? Watching must be a boreforyou,


00:38:50.861 --> 00:38:52.522
Up for a match?


00:38:55.399 --> 00:38:56.832
Oh yeah...


00:38:56.934 --> 00:38:59.129
You don't understand what I'm saying, eh?


00:38:59.570 --> 00:39:01.629
Well I guess we're in trouble here.


00:39:26.797 --> 00:39:28.230
Throw me a wooden sword!


00:39:41.479 --> 00:39:43.606
Excuse me,


00:39:46.851 --> 00:39:49.411
I guess they're...out?


00:39:52.323 --> 00:39:53.224
[Thanks for the room]


00:39:53.224 --> 00:39:55.426
[Thanks for the room]
What's it say?


00:39:55.426 --> 00:39:55.858
[Thanks for the room]


00:39:58.796 --> 00:40:02.664
If you're going to live alone,
you better learn to read and write.


00:40:02.767 --> 00:40:04.325
Your back's slumping.


00:40:05.069 --> 00:40:07.367
I didn't tell you to get all rigid.


00:40:08.005 --> 00:40:09.495
You don't need to bug me about everything!


00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:13.173
If I don't tell you you're awful, you'll never get good.


00:40:13.544 --> 00:40:16.104
If you just tell me what I'm doing right,
I'll get even better!


00:40:20.017 --> 00:40:21.644
The weather's so nice.


00:40:22.586 --> 00:40:24.918
To think that someone actually injured you,


00:40:25.089 --> 00:40:27.148
Who was it you fought?


00:40:27.625 --> 00:40:29.718
A man from the Ming Dynasty.


00:40:29.960 --> 00:40:33.123
He had blue eyes, and was over sixfeettall!


00:40:33.397 --> 00:40:35.797
Wow, like a real demon.


00:40:36.000 --> 00:40:37.968
He might be scarier than a demon.


00:40:38.135 --> 00:40:41.332
He's the second person I've ever seen with that level of skill.


00:40:41.739 --> 00:40:42.797
The second?


00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:44.803
An old acquaintance of mine.


00:40:45.242 --> 00:40:48.871
When I served the Ooatari province,


00:40:49.013 --> 00:40:52.278
We fought side by side in the wars.


00:40:52.550 --> 00:40:56.646
But after a certain battle, he disappeared.


00:40:57.288 --> 00:40:59.415
Seems he'd gotten sick of war.


00:40:59.457 --> 00:41:01.891
Then he was a kind man, right?


00:41:02.593 --> 00:41:04.720
He was just weak hearted.


00:41:04.962 --> 00:41:09.865
He's a man that threw away the god's gift that he had.


00:41:10.201 --> 00:41:14.900
So then how will you use your gifted skills?


00:41:15.239 --> 00:41:19.801
That's obvious. I'll use it to get even
more strength and climb even higher.


00:41:20.878 --> 00:41:23.506
You sound almost as if you're going to conquer the country.


00:41:24.448 --> 00:41:29.010
I've got no intention of an aspiration within a set limit.


00:41:29.453 --> 00:41:34.550
Me, I'll set my limit at the peak of my aspiration!


00:41:46.837 --> 00:41:48.270
That's a lot of scars!


00:41:49.073 --> 00:41:51.598
They're what I got for going to war.


00:41:51.876 --> 00:41:54.071
What province did you serve?


00:41:54.845 --> 00:41:56.472
It's not worth naming,


00:41:56.647 --> 00:41:59.616
It was destroyed and doesn't exist anymore.


00:42:00.317 --> 00:42:01.978
You don't volunteer anymore?


00:42:04.555 --> 00:42:05.487
Yeah...


00:42:05.623 --> 00:42:07.056
I got sick of it.


00:42:10.561 --> 00:42:13.587
Oh yeah, I still haven't asked you your name?


00:42:14.198 --> 00:42:17.929
As a samurai you must have some 
really fancy name, right?


00:42:19.503 --> 00:42:20.265
Akage


00:42:20.571 --> 00:42:23.039
Yeah, that's a cool one.


00:42:23.707 --> 00:42:26.335
[Nanashi =Nameless]
Akaomi Nanashi


00:42:26.610 --> 00:42:29.272
What!? Don't tease me!


00:42:33.584 --> 00:42:34.778
I'm not teasing you.


00:42:35.819 --> 00:42:37.810
It's Nanashi because I've got no name.


00:42:38.589 --> 00:42:42.116
Each time I changed provinces, 
so did my name.


00:42:55.506 --> 00:42:57.167
Grab that bamboo shute.


00:43:18.996 --> 00:43:20.930
By dying it with berries,


00:43:21.265 --> 00:43:23.290
It should last for about ten days.


00:43:24.101 --> 00:43:26.433
You're a...foreigner?


00:43:26.770 --> 00:43:29.204
Who knows? Even I don't.


00:43:30.474 --> 00:43:32.965
I hear I was picked up from a foreign ship,


00:43:33.344 --> 00:43:35.141
But I was the only one left alive.


00:43:36.747 --> 00:43:39.079
There were those that hated me,


00:43:39.216 --> 00:43:42.014
But since I learned this method, 
those problems went away.


00:43:42.920 --> 00:43:46.617
The life I have now is far better than
the one I had when volunteering.


00:43:58.502 --> 00:43:59.662
What's wrong?


00:43:59.837 --> 00:44:02.203
If you stand there you'll catch a cold.


00:44:09.713 --> 00:44:11.510
You sure are quiet suddenly.


00:44:11.749 --> 00:44:14.013
Did my hair color scare you?


00:44:14.118 --> 00:44:15.710
I'm not scared at all!


00:44:15.886 --> 00:44:18.184
I've seen hundreds of foreigners before!


00:44:18.389 --> 00:44:21.187
It's just...I was surprised.


00:44:23.594 --> 00:44:25.152
You feeling good little dog?


00:44:27.131 --> 00:44:28.098
Pursuers.


00:44:28.832 --> 00:44:31.562
Pretend you haven't noticed and
start talking about something.


00:44:32.870 --> 00:44:33.734
What?


00:44:33.771 --> 00:44:37.229
Still, I'm surprised you've seen 
so many foreigners.


00:44:37.841 --> 00:44:39.365
Where did you see them?


00:44:39.943 --> 00:44:41.171
Tell me.


00:44:45.149 --> 00:44:46.446
In the Ming Dynasty.


00:44:47.084 --> 00:44:49.450
Until two years ago, I lived there.


00:44:49.920 --> 00:44:51.410
Were you living by yourself?


00:44:51.955 --> 00:44:54.150
I was with my little brother and Tobimaru.


00:44:54.558 --> 00:44:55.650
And your mother?


00:44:56.627 --> 00:44:59.619
I hear she died soon after I was born.


00:45:00.064 --> 00:45:00.996
Your dad?


00:45:01.699 --> 00:45:05.100
When I was six...he went to where she is.


00:45:06.103 --> 00:45:08.628
With no parents, how'd you come here?


00:45:09.473 --> 00:45:11.998
One day, when I was about to be sold,


00:45:12.209 --> 00:45:15.201
A monk who came to Ming to train saved me.


00:45:16.847 --> 00:45:19.577
And he brought me back here with him on a boat.


00:45:19.883 --> 00:45:23.182
When I got here, I stayed at his temple.


00:45:24.321 --> 00:45:25.982
Why'd you leave the temple?


00:45:27.958 --> 00:45:28.947
The temple...


00:45:29.460 --> 00:45:31.087
was attacked.


00:45:40.571 --> 00:45:42.539
Let go! I said let go!


00:45:42.673 --> 00:45:43.901
From Akaike?


00:45:44.007 --> 00:45:46.771
No, no, no, no that's not it!


00:45:46.877 --> 00:45:50.540
We're just thieves passing by!


00:45:50.714 --> 00:45:52.443
Just thieves!


00:45:52.649 --> 00:45:54.617
Tobimaru, let him go.


00:45:56.520 --> 00:45:57.782
Please forgive me!


00:45:57.821 --> 00:45:59.914
Please forgive me!!


00:46:00.224 --> 00:46:01.748
Hurry up and get lost.


00:46:02.292 --> 00:46:04.317
Th...Thankyou!


00:46:09.733 --> 00:46:10.995
Well then...


00:46:11.235 --> 00:46:12.463
Wait a second.


00:46:14.438 --> 00:46:16.565
Leave all your money.


00:46:17.341 --> 00:46:20.606
Money? No we don't even have a sen!


00:46:20.844 --> 00:46:22.243
Come on,


00:46:22.913 --> 00:46:26.144
Please believe me! If we had money, 
we wouldn't be thieving!


00:46:28.719 --> 00:46:29.947
A nice sound.


00:46:41.832 --> 00:46:43.561
Silly thieves.


00:46:43.734 --> 00:46:45.258
Even silly people have their good points!


00:46:46.036 --> 00:46:48.436
I was planning on speeding up a bit,


00:46:48.939 --> 00:46:50.236
Is the dog ok?


00:46:50.374 --> 00:46:53.605
Yeah. If anythings wrong, 
I'll tell you.


00:46:54.278 --> 00:46:57.247
Hang on tight so you don't fall!


00:46:57.414 --> 00:46:58.312
Ok!


00:47:21.371 --> 00:47:24.340
You're right. 
It really feels like we're flying.


00:47:24.675 --> 00:47:26.074
It's not bad at all!


00:47:33.951 --> 00:47:36.511
It's taken many years...


00:47:36.887 --> 00:47:39.856
To bring you here before us, Byakuran,


00:47:40.390 --> 00:47:43.018
When the source of immortality is in his hands,


00:47:43.694 --> 00:47:47.630
The Emperor will be most pleased.


00:47:49.166 --> 00:47:52.602
Geshin and Suishin are heading
to the temple tonight as planned.


00:47:52.936 --> 00:47:56.497
Kachuu will be in charge of the ritual at the altar tomorrow.


00:47:56.874 --> 00:48:01.504
Everyone else, either work on finding the child,
or the preparations for leaving this castle.


00:48:01.812 --> 00:48:03.746
The alter finished in time,


00:48:04.047 --> 00:48:06.538
But the rest ofthe plan has been a complete mess.


00:48:06.650 --> 00:48:09.585
I really could not face the Emperor like this.


00:48:09.753 --> 00:48:14.281
I think it's about time to start thinking
about if we do not have the child.


00:48:15.926 --> 00:48:19.794
If the full moon in two days passes,
the next won't before another year.


00:48:20.163 --> 00:48:23.030
In that time it's possible another war could breakout,


00:48:23.133 --> 00:48:26.899
And this province could be destroyed
causing us to lose everything.


00:48:27.037 --> 00:48:28.004
So then...


00:48:28.138 --> 00:48:31.266
If we delay the ceremony a few days they'll never know.


00:48:31.508 --> 00:48:35.501
You're saying to send a false message to the Emperor?


00:48:35.712 --> 00:48:38.340
I do not believe the blood will change.


00:48:38.448 --> 00:48:40.177
Shut your mouth!


00:48:40.317 --> 00:48:43.115
Another way is to find the child in Ming,


00:48:43.153 --> 00:48:45.951
And create the Alter in Ming.


00:48:46.056 --> 00:48:49.048
In Ming even if we have to wait a year or two...


00:48:49.192 --> 00:48:50.784
That's enough!


00:48:57.267 --> 00:48:59.292
I'll go work on preparations for our escape from this province.


00:49:09.279 --> 00:49:10.303
That fool!


00:49:11.248 --> 00:49:14.615
To speak of fooling the Emperor!


00:49:15.018 --> 00:49:17.077
No matter how skilled he is,


00:49:17.220 --> 00:49:19.654
A warrior is just a warrior!


00:49:22.259 --> 00:49:25.023
There's no way to stop you from handing him over?


00:49:25.595 --> 00:49:29.190
For the sake of our religion, we can't refuse them.


00:49:29.399 --> 00:49:30.366
But...!


00:49:30.701 --> 00:49:31.969
This would defy our Buddhist ideals-


00:49:31.969 --> 00:49:32.169
You fool!
This would defy our Buddhist ideals-


00:49:32.169 --> 00:49:33.158
You fool!


00:49:33.270 --> 00:49:36.068
Protecting our religion is our ideal!


00:49:36.139 --> 00:49:38.542
Be happy you are still alive!


00:49:38.542 --> 00:49:39.600
Wait!


00:49:40.177 --> 00:49:41.075
Let go!


00:49:56.326 --> 00:49:57.350
This voice...?


00:49:57.527 --> 00:49:59.654
It suddenly started two hours ago.


00:50:07.137 --> 00:50:09.935
So in the end you didn't get the reward?


00:50:10.007 --> 00:50:15.104
The samurai thought I was lying to him.


00:50:15.178 --> 00:50:19.342
He was really, really mad. I thought I was going to die.


00:50:19.750 --> 00:50:22.617
I told you,
you gotta stay away from deals that sound too good.


00:50:27.891 --> 00:50:30.291
I wonder if it'll snow tomorrow?


00:50:30.427 --> 00:50:31.325
Huh?


00:50:31.928 --> 00:50:34.624
Look how sunny it is, what are you saying?


00:50:34.798 --> 00:50:40.862
Look, even though the west sky is cloudy
I can see the sun shining all bright.


00:50:40.937 --> 00:50:44.065
That's a symbol that it's gonna snow.


00:50:45.308 --> 00:50:46.209
Drug! Hurry! The Drug!


00:50:46.209 --> 00:50:47.778
He's told us everything.
Drug! Hurry! The Drug!


00:50:47.778 --> 00:50:48.369
Drug! Hurry! The Drug!


00:50:54.317 --> 00:50:55.249
This is?


00:50:55.619 --> 00:50:57.780
The drug he had on him.


00:50:59.122 --> 00:51:01.920
This is what he's like when he can't depend on it?


00:51:02.092 --> 00:51:03.389
Put him to rest.


00:51:09.199 --> 00:51:10.598
Senyaku?


00:51:11.768 --> 00:51:13.963
According to the Ming we captured,


00:51:14.071 --> 00:51:19.065
They're searching for a drug that makes one immortal.


00:51:19.943 --> 00:51:22.377
Immortal?


00:51:34.524 --> 00:51:38.290
It was foretold in a Ming prophecy.


00:51:38.361 --> 00:51:41.353
You're saying that was the start of this?


00:51:41.698 --> 00:51:42.722
Yes.


00:51:43.166 --> 00:51:47.125
According to the warrior Doshi, it allows you to live forever.


00:51:47.838 --> 00:51:51.831
By taking the blood of a child
foretold of once every hundred years,


00:51:52.142 --> 00:51:54.667
You can create a drug that makes you immortal.


00:51:55.512 --> 00:51:57.139
The Emperor believes this,


00:51:57.347 --> 00:51:59.508
And ordered his men to find the child.


00:51:59.649 --> 00:52:01.844
The pursuers crossed the ocean to find him?


00:52:02.786 --> 00:52:05.653
The alter fortress with a mechanism to tell the exact time,


00:52:06.456 --> 00:52:10.654
This is all to gather the blood according to the foretelling.


00:52:13.130 --> 00:52:15.690
Once every hundred years?


00:52:15.932 --> 00:52:19.834
Still...is immortality even possible?


00:52:20.370 --> 00:52:21.962
Who cares!


00:52:22.906 --> 00:52:28.105
What's important is that the child's
worth even more than a ship of gold.


00:52:28.445 --> 00:52:29.742
What should we do now?


00:52:30.046 --> 00:52:31.445
As if I need to tell you?


00:52:31.548 --> 00:52:35.746
Find the child first, and take care of the Ming.


00:52:35.952 --> 00:52:40.286
But they're the only ones who
know what the child looks like...


00:52:40.557 --> 00:52:44.459
And since yesterday they've been
snooping around the whole province.


00:52:44.728 --> 00:52:46.423
I've already taken a step.


00:52:46.630 --> 00:52:51.192
Even if they can't speak our language,
I'll have them crying at my feet.


00:52:51.768 --> 00:52:53.929
No matter what they try to do,


00:52:54.237 --> 00:52:56.467
This is our province!


00:53:04.047 --> 00:53:06.277
Are you sad because Rarou isn't around?


00:53:07.651 --> 00:53:10.415
Almost like a wife whose lost their husband.


00:53:10.787 --> 00:53:12.152
Don't make fun of me!


00:53:12.422 --> 00:53:15.949
The reason I look sad is because
I don't have my hawk at my side.


00:53:16.059 --> 00:53:17.651
Good job trying to hide it.


00:53:22.899 --> 00:53:25.766
If we fail tomorrow...another year in this country?


00:53:27.204 --> 00:53:30.367
Still upset over your clash with Lord Byakuran yesterday?


00:53:30.674 --> 00:53:31.402
That's nothing.


00:53:31.975 --> 00:53:36.639
What I'm thinking about is the one who killed Kingai.


00:53:36.846 --> 00:53:38.143
Really,


00:53:38.782 --> 00:53:41.945
To care more about a strong guy than the Emperor's orders...


00:53:42.786 --> 00:53:43.718
It's just like you.


00:53:44.087 --> 00:53:45.918
I'll follow the Emperor's orders.


00:53:46.556 --> 00:53:50.720
Even if that means ending up like Doshi or worse.


00:53:52.028 --> 00:53:55.293
Right now the lord's army is watching in wait,


00:53:55.332 --> 00:53:57.562
I'll be leading them.


00:53:57.767 --> 00:53:59.667
Make sure you keep up.


00:53:59.769 --> 00:54:01.134
I'll be looking forward to it.


00:54:14.584 --> 00:54:17.178
I wonder if that's the princess playing...


00:54:19.856 --> 00:54:22.381
Give up on those aspirations.


00:54:23.026 --> 00:54:27.190
It's best to set your aspirations within your limits.


00:54:31.334 --> 00:54:32.995
Wait up Lord Itadori!


00:55:12.676 --> 00:55:13.370
Hey,


00:55:15.278 --> 00:55:17.872
You're a pretty skilled swordsman, aren'tyou?


00:55:19.049 --> 00:55:20.414
What about it?


00:55:20.450 --> 00:55:24.682
It would've been great if you taught me, not just
how to ride a horse, but how to sword fight.


00:55:26.956 --> 00:55:28.480
What'll you do if you learn how?


00:55:28.625 --> 00:55:31.719
What will I do? That's obvious, it'll come in handy in life.


00:55:32.329 --> 00:55:34.889
The power of a sword's dependable!


00:55:35.799 --> 00:55:36.731
Depend on it...


00:55:38.001 --> 00:55:40.731
I thought like that when I was a kid.


00:55:41.204 --> 00:55:42.466
You think different now?


00:56:01.524 --> 00:56:03.754
You were really shook up.


00:56:05.362 --> 00:56:06.351
You've been awake?


00:56:11.000 --> 00:56:12.900
I can't sleep in this.


00:56:13.169 --> 00:56:14.568
I agree with that.


00:56:15.271 --> 00:56:19.139
Hey, you want me to teach you a way to avoid bad dreams?


00:56:21.778 --> 00:56:25.976
You've just gotta hold something
you love and think about nice things.


00:56:28.184 --> 00:56:31.119
That's what I've been doing up until now.


00:56:49.372 --> 00:56:50.339
Lord Byakuran,


00:56:52.909 --> 00:56:54.570
Are you having trouble sleeping?


00:56:54.878 --> 00:56:57.847
I was just thinking a bit.


00:56:59.249 --> 00:57:00.307
Fuugo,


00:57:00.517 --> 00:57:04.920
If you could live forever, what would you do?


00:57:05.321 --> 00:57:06.515
Hmm...


00:57:06.790 --> 00:57:10.556
My desire is simply to live strongly, 
even if it's for a shorttime.


00:57:10.627 --> 00:57:12.117
Youth...


00:57:12.462 --> 00:57:17.161
I've lived for so many years now. It wouldn't
be strange for me to pass at anytime.


00:57:17.233 --> 00:57:18.165
But,


00:57:18.334 --> 00:57:24.170
Strangely, the longer I continue to live the
greater my desire to live longer becomes.


00:57:24.474 --> 00:57:33.678
Even understanding that this drug we search for
by the Emperor's order is not to be used for myself,


00:57:34.083 --> 00:57:39.020
Somewhere deep down,
I feel I'm searching for my own benefit.


00:57:59.976 --> 00:58:03.104
To think Shirato's Mangaku Temple was this amazing...


00:58:03.646 --> 00:58:05.079
The promised good.


00:58:08.718 --> 00:58:10.185
By the way,


00:58:10.353 --> 00:58:13.413
At the time I was all into it and said it was worth ten ryo,


00:58:13.857 --> 00:58:14.949
Actually...


00:58:15.091 --> 00:58:16.456
That's what I figured.


00:58:16.493 --> 00:58:16.925
Huh?


00:58:17.393 --> 00:58:19.657
It's the kind of thing you'd think of.


00:58:19.929 --> 00:58:23.956
Well, I should be able to at least get about five ryo, right?


00:58:24.167 --> 00:58:25.259
Well....


00:58:27.437 --> 00:58:29.428
On....one ryo?


00:58:29.772 --> 00:58:32.297
Well it's not bad for a memento, right?


00:58:32.775 --> 00:58:34.208
I'm sure it's got its good points!


00:58:34.978 --> 00:58:37.242
What a kid.


00:58:37.347 --> 00:58:38.336
I'm not a kid, I'm...


00:58:38.414 --> 00:58:39.574
Kotarou?


00:58:42.418 --> 00:58:43.316
Kotarou!


00:58:44.187 --> 00:58:45.313
Shouan!


00:58:46.022 --> 00:58:47.319
Shouan!


00:58:51.027 --> 00:58:53.325
Shouan, you're safe!


00:58:53.696 --> 00:58:55.095
I was worried!


00:58:55.164 --> 00:58:57.724
I'm glad you're okay as well.


00:58:57.901 --> 00:58:59.266
I'm so happy,


00:58:59.402 --> 00:59:03.031
I thought maybe if I came here, 
I'd be able to meet you again.


00:59:03.439 --> 00:59:04.531
I...


00:59:06.376 --> 00:59:09.743
Here, let me guide you to monk Zekkai's room.


00:59:15.218 --> 00:59:16.412
Nanashi!


00:59:17.186 --> 00:59:18.778
See ya, kid!


00:59:20.056 --> 00:59:23.389
If you ever want a name, come here and see me whenever!


00:59:24.093 --> 00:59:26.527
I'll think of an amazing name for you!


01:00:26.990 --> 01:00:27.979
Shouan?


01:00:30.360 --> 01:00:32.624
It took you quite sometime to get here.


01:00:33.363 --> 01:00:35.263
Monk Zekkai?


01:00:36.232 --> 01:00:40.828
That was a long wait...we finally meet.


01:00:52.649 --> 01:00:53.673
Let me go!


01:00:53.750 --> 01:00:54.717
Let me go!!


01:00:54.951 --> 01:00:56.145
I said let me go!


01:00:56.252 --> 01:00:58.186
You tricked me, you bastard!


01:00:58.354 --> 01:00:59.480
I trusted you!


01:01:00.189 --> 01:01:01.451
Shit!


01:01:07.163 --> 01:01:08.596
Don't kill him.


01:01:08.765 --> 01:01:10.926
It'll be easier to carry him if he's quiet.


01:01:11.300 --> 01:01:12.096
Let's go.


01:01:13.703 --> 01:01:16.035
They came. Get your swords ready.


01:01:16.406 --> 01:01:17.395
Attack!


01:01:20.777 --> 01:01:21.573
It's a trap.


01:01:37.560 --> 01:01:40.791
Head to the castle, we need to 
inform Lord Itadori!


01:01:41.264 --> 01:01:42.253
Bastard!!


01:01:47.236 --> 01:01:48.225
So then,


01:01:48.871 --> 01:01:50.202
Where do you want to go?


01:02:05.455 --> 01:02:06.581
Hurry.


01:02:59.242 --> 01:03:00.209
Who are you!?


01:03:01.377 --> 01:03:02.779
Where'd they take the kid?!!


01:03:02.779 --> 01:03:03.643
Don't tell him!


01:03:03.713 --> 01:03:04.577
Don't say any--


01:03:05.314 --> 01:03:06.645
Answer me!


01:03:06.916 --> 01:03:08.315
Answer me!


01:03:08.618 --> 01:03:09.414
Tonight...


01:03:10.753 --> 01:03:14.154
Tonight...they plan on killing him 
and taking his blood.


01:03:14.657 --> 01:03:16.022
For what purpose?


01:03:16.092 --> 01:03:16.888
I don't know.


01:03:16.926 --> 01:03:17.756
Where?


01:03:17.827 --> 01:03:18.418
I don't know.


01:03:18.628 --> 01:03:19.652
I just don't know!


01:03:19.829 --> 01:03:22.662
They didn't trust us.


01:03:22.799 --> 01:03:26.030
If we didn't hand him over, they were going to kill us.


01:03:26.602 --> 01:03:29.435
You handed him over knowing they were going to kill him?!


01:03:29.705 --> 01:03:31.969
I wanted to save him.


01:03:32.475 --> 01:03:34.136
It was monk Zekkai who decided it,


01:03:34.610 --> 01:03:35.668
Not me!!


01:03:35.778 --> 01:03:38.042
In the end you abandoned him!


01:03:42.652 --> 01:03:43.550
That's right...


01:03:44.387 --> 01:03:45.649
It's just as you say...


01:03:46.289 --> 01:03:49.349
Like you said, I abandoned that child.


01:03:50.259 --> 01:03:53.490
Being threatened...and wanting to save my own life...


01:03:54.030 --> 01:03:55.429
I abandoned that child.


01:03:56.032 --> 01:03:56.930
But,


01:03:57.500 --> 01:03:59.331
If you had been in my place,


01:03:59.869 --> 01:04:01.928
You would've done the same as me!!


01:04:04.574 --> 01:04:05.563
Am I wrong?


01:04:05.975 --> 01:04:10.378
Can you even imagine betraying your superiors
and following through with your own ideals?!


01:04:11.080 --> 01:04:11.978
You can't!


01:04:12.114 --> 01:04:13.046
Right!?


01:04:15.351 --> 01:04:16.943
Could you do it?


01:04:18.020 --> 01:04:19.612
You talk all superior,


01:04:19.689 --> 01:04:22.055
But are you going to save that child?!


01:04:22.291 --> 01:04:23.417
You won't.


01:04:23.593 --> 01:04:26.289
You won't go to something that 
you know is certain death!


01:04:26.362 --> 01:04:27.386
You...


01:04:27.697 --> 01:04:28.994
In the end,


01:04:29.198 --> 01:04:30.631
You're the same as me!


01:04:49.919 --> 01:04:51.887
For a chicken shit like you,


01:04:52.488 --> 01:04:54.183
A monk's robe is a waste.


01:05:13.509 --> 01:05:14.703
What color?


01:05:15.044 --> 01:05:16.306
It's yellow and red.


01:05:17.313 --> 01:05:18.803
They got him in time!


01:05:19.048 --> 01:05:21.243
Yellow means they have the child,


01:05:21.417 --> 01:05:22.349
What's red?


01:05:22.518 --> 01:05:25.544
It means that this castle's soldiers 
have betrayed us!


01:05:25.788 --> 01:05:27.881
Hurry and call Rarou.


01:05:34.530 --> 01:05:35.861
Please wait!


01:05:36.232 --> 01:05:37.164
Wait!


01:05:37.433 --> 01:05:38.923
I said wait!


01:05:39.769 --> 01:05:40.929
What business do you have here?


01:05:41.070 --> 01:05:43.402
I don't mind. Let him through.


01:05:44.674 --> 01:05:47.268
So you've noticed what's really going on,


01:05:47.810 --> 01:05:51.473
So how will the deal go today?


01:06:23.045 --> 01:06:25.570
Why did you attack without my order?


01:06:25.881 --> 01:06:28.941
The Lord's order was to get the child as soon as possible.


01:06:29.018 --> 01:06:31.612
I'm the one in command of this army!


01:06:36.225 --> 01:06:37.192
Where's the child?


01:06:37.259 --> 01:06:39.090
It seems he doesn't know.


01:06:39.362 --> 01:06:40.920
I have a good guess where.


01:06:41.530 --> 01:06:43.327
It's likely the Shishine Fortress.


01:06:43.599 --> 01:06:45.794
What should we do with this monk?


01:06:46.168 --> 01:06:49.365
He's a traitor who conspired with
Ming. Send him to the otherworld.


01:06:49.572 --> 01:06:50.163
Yes sir.


01:06:50.473 --> 01:06:51.371
That's...?


01:06:53.009 --> 01:06:54.377
The monk's disciple.


01:06:54.377 --> 01:06:57.278
It seems he hung himself while the other was unconscious.


01:06:58.114 --> 01:06:58.910
I see.


01:06:59.015 --> 01:07:00.812
For now, we're returning to the castle.


01:07:00.950 --> 01:07:03.646
The rest of you wait here for the next order.


01:07:03.953 --> 01:07:05.477
A message!


01:07:08.324 --> 01:07:09.518
A message!


01:07:14.563 --> 01:07:15.495
The lord...?


01:07:15.564 --> 01:07:18.761
He was wide open with no guards!


01:07:19.301 --> 01:07:21.292
What about Isogai and Fuchiome?


01:07:21.404 --> 01:07:22.996
Unfortunately they were...


01:07:24.540 --> 01:07:27.407
You just sat and watched the Lord be kidnapped?


01:07:27.510 --> 01:07:30.604
He said he'd kill me. I couldn't do a thing!


01:07:30.846 --> 01:07:32.905
Why didn't you give chase?!


01:07:33.049 --> 01:07:34.949
The main horses were poisoned!


01:07:35.051 --> 01:07:37.144
All that was left were the work horses!


01:07:37.286 --> 01:07:40.084
We sent the Wataoki and Kawashi armies towards the Fortress,


01:07:40.289 --> 01:07:43.816
But even if they rush, they won't reach it before night!


01:07:44.360 --> 01:07:46.828
You sent the Wataoki and Kawashi armies?


01:07:46.896 --> 01:07:47.590
Yes sir.


01:07:47.797 --> 01:07:50.960
You are the only commander left Lord Itadori!


01:07:51.133 --> 01:07:54.227
The princess said to leave the command to you.


01:07:54.437 --> 01:07:56.234
I came as fast as I could.


01:07:58.207 --> 01:07:59.265
Jyuurouta,


01:07:59.642 --> 01:08:01.735
Get a horse and armor ready.


01:08:02.078 --> 01:08:04.012
One for each of us.


01:08:04.313 --> 01:08:05.177
Understood.


01:08:05.848 --> 01:08:07.213
We're changing plans.


01:08:07.349 --> 01:08:08.907
All of you, head for the castle.


01:08:09.051 --> 01:08:11.645
Myself and Jyuurouta will head for the Shishine Fortress.


01:08:23.532 --> 01:08:29.061
While we buy time, Lord Byakuran you cross over the sea.


01:08:29.405 --> 01:08:30.929
He sure gave us some trouble.


01:08:31.474 --> 01:08:33.567
Just a bit more patience.


01:08:33.809 --> 01:08:36.744
After we complete this, we'll say goodbye to this country.


01:08:37.847 --> 01:08:39.109
That's true.


01:08:39.248 --> 01:08:41.011
We can finally go home.


01:08:48.290 --> 01:08:49.723
It's yours, right?


01:08:49.959 --> 01:08:53.326
The guy who chased us at the Mangaku Temple had it.


01:08:53.996 --> 01:08:55.486
What happened to him?


01:08:55.965 --> 01:08:58.058
He should have been no match for you, but...


01:08:59.935 --> 01:09:02.199
I sent him to the otherworld with this.


01:09:13.616 --> 01:09:15.811
Just because your master's not around,


01:09:15.951 --> 01:09:17.885
You better not think about biting me!


01:09:22.725 --> 01:09:23.885
Afraid?


01:09:26.562 --> 01:09:30.833
Pretending that you don't understand?
Or are you so afraid you can't speak?


01:09:30.833 --> 01:09:32.562
Everyone eventually dies.


01:09:32.868 --> 01:09:38.040
There's no one with infinite time in this world.


01:09:38.040 --> 01:09:41.669
Even you'll live strongly in the time that's left for you.


01:09:42.344 --> 01:09:43.868
If you're going to kill me, hurry up and do it!


01:09:44.413 --> 01:09:48.179
Don't rush to your death, I have something I must askyou.


01:09:48.417 --> 01:09:53.912
When you were taken from the temple,
there was a man who tried to save you.


01:09:54.156 --> 01:09:55.453
A friend?


01:09:55.558 --> 01:09:56.786
No idea.


01:09:57.059 --> 01:09:58.924
Answer honestly.


01:09:59.595 --> 01:10:01.790
I don't have any friends!


01:10:02.898 --> 01:10:06.163
It seems like I won't get an answer from you.


01:10:06.635 --> 01:10:11.299
It doesn't matter...that man was killed by my comrades.


01:10:25.854 --> 01:10:27.151
Jyuurouta!


01:10:27.289 --> 01:10:29.223
You know this area pretty well, right?


01:10:29.491 --> 01:10:32.426
There's a shortcut. But I don't know if the horses can make it.


01:10:32.661 --> 01:10:34.424
I don't care if they break their legs,


01:10:34.597 --> 01:10:35.564
Hurry!


01:11:15.437 --> 01:11:16.631
Can you see it?


01:11:16.972 --> 01:11:21.238
When this hand points high, 
your soul will leave your body,


01:11:21.277 --> 01:11:25.441
And the blood in your body will
continue to live for the Emperor.


01:11:26.382 --> 01:11:28.907
Think of it as an honor.


01:11:36.692 --> 01:11:38.091
Are you worried?


01:11:38.794 --> 01:11:39.522
No...


01:11:40.162 --> 01:11:41.322
Be not afraid,


01:11:41.430 --> 01:11:47.198
I hear Shougen is a great warrior,
with many comrades at his side.


01:11:47.303 --> 01:11:50.329
I am sure he will save the lord.


01:11:55.577 --> 01:11:56.635
Can you do it?


01:11:56.712 --> 01:12:00.808
The Wataoki and Kawashi armies 
are like brothers to me,


01:12:00.883 --> 01:12:02.817
You won't need to worry.


01:12:03.018 --> 01:12:03.985
I'm counting on you!


01:12:04.119 --> 01:12:05.313
Leave it to me!


01:12:19.234 --> 01:12:20.292
It's Jyuurouta!


01:12:20.536 --> 01:12:23.004
Look! Lord Itadori has come too!


01:12:23.272 --> 01:12:24.603
Lord Itadori!


01:12:24.707 --> 01:12:26.402
We've been waiting for you!


01:12:50.899 --> 01:12:52.594
What should we do?


01:12:52.735 --> 01:12:55.602
Use the feudal lord as a shield 
and buy us time.


01:12:56.205 --> 01:12:59.333
There's only two hours left until 
the ritual.


01:13:14.523 --> 01:13:15.854
Th...the lord?


01:13:15.891 --> 01:13:17.188
What a disgrace.


01:13:18.594 --> 01:13:19.959
Shougen!


01:13:20.396 --> 01:13:22.887
Is that you Shougen?


01:13:22.931 --> 01:13:24.364
How can we attack now?


01:13:24.600 --> 01:13:27.763
What does Lord Itadori plan to do?


01:13:28.137 --> 01:13:29.126
Jyuurouta.


01:13:40.349 --> 01:13:41.611
Shougen!


01:13:44.987 --> 01:13:46.386
Do not panic!


01:13:47.022 --> 01:13:50.958
It's time for you to ask your hearts!


01:13:51.093 --> 01:13:52.424
Will you follow me?!


01:13:52.528 --> 01:13:54.553
Or will you follow the dead lord?!


01:13:55.230 --> 01:13:57.933
If you follow me, 
the country is as good as ours!


01:13:57.933 --> 01:13:59.764
Bastard!


01:14:02.304 --> 01:14:04.829
I will follow Lord Itadori!


01:14:05.007 --> 01:14:06.304
What will you do?!


01:14:06.508 --> 01:14:08.408
I'll follow Lord Itadori too!


01:14:08.577 --> 01:14:10.101
Me...me, too!


01:14:10.579 --> 01:14:12.103
I'll follow Lord Itadori!


01:14:12.548 --> 01:14:13.037
Me too!


01:14:13.248 --> 01:14:14.340
Me too!


01:14:15.217 --> 01:14:17.742
We shall conquer this fortress!


01:14:21.123 --> 01:14:21.782
What?


01:14:22.057 --> 01:14:24.855
Unlike our Emperor,


01:14:24.927 --> 01:14:28.419
To them a lord is just a descendant of a bloodline.


01:14:28.831 --> 01:14:31.265
Useless as a hostage it seems.


01:14:32.634 --> 01:14:34.499
Damn barbarians!


01:14:35.070 --> 01:14:37.197
I'm leaving the ritual up to Kachuu.


01:14:37.372 --> 01:14:39.363
Get down there and fight them off!


01:14:44.713 --> 01:14:45.873
Fire!


01:15:10.839 --> 01:15:11.396
Shit.


01:15:14.676 --> 01:15:15.734
Damn.


01:15:43.338 --> 01:15:44.362
Back!


01:15:45.741 --> 01:15:46.673
Forward!


01:15:53.048 --> 01:15:53.810
Forward!


01:16:03.325 --> 01:16:04.485
I'll be going first.


01:16:05.961 --> 01:16:07.155
Charge!


01:16:07.195 --> 01:16:08.492
Lord Itadori!


01:16:08.630 --> 01:16:10.598
After we've taken their heads,


01:16:10.766 --> 01:16:12.757
I have a request!


01:16:13.035 --> 01:16:15.162
The princess is as good as yours!


01:16:48.704 --> 01:16:49.830
Got you!


01:17:02.484 --> 01:17:03.348
Bitch!


01:17:06.121 --> 01:17:07.486
That's what you deserve!


01:17:21.069 --> 01:17:22.127
Bows!


01:17:31.346 --> 01:17:32.813
Aim well!


01:17:39.187 --> 01:17:40.245
Split into two groups!


01:17:40.288 --> 01:17:40.720
Yes!


01:18:19.861 --> 01:18:21.192
Don't back down!


01:19:04.039 --> 01:19:05.301
Now's the time!


01:19:05.474 --> 01:19:07.772
Rush in while they're distracted!


01:19:15.417 --> 01:19:16.611
Back down!


01:19:16.752 --> 01:19:19.084
You guys go fight someone else.


01:19:20.088 --> 01:19:21.988
This guy's my...


01:19:22.157 --> 01:19:23.283
Prey!


01:19:23.959 --> 01:19:25.085
I wouldn't try.


01:19:25.660 --> 01:19:28.288
The spear is actually my true weapon.


01:19:28.530 --> 01:19:30.521
It won't go like before!


01:19:36.838 --> 01:19:38.965
I'm enough of an opponent for all of you!


01:20:22.217 --> 01:20:25.345
I can't say I don't understand where you're coming from,


01:20:25.887 --> 01:20:27.411
But it's an uneeded emotion.


01:20:28.256 --> 01:20:30.156
This is the world we live in.


01:20:30.659 --> 01:20:34.686
Our battle sounded the victory horn
for our lord to become the new ruler.


01:20:35.831 --> 01:20:38.595
This is all thanks to your hard work.


01:20:39.734 --> 01:20:40.666
In all honesty,


01:20:40.869 --> 01:20:42.860
I'm completely jealous.


01:21:13.635 --> 01:21:16.195
Hurry up and do it, you coward!!!


01:22:31.813 --> 01:22:32.837
It's time.


01:22:39.821 --> 01:22:40.719
Tobimaru!


01:22:45.527 --> 01:22:46.892
Kotarou!!!


01:23:00.909 --> 01:23:03.002
That guy...


01:23:06.648 --> 01:23:07.444
Move!


01:23:11.319 --> 01:23:12.513
Move!!!


01:23:32.407 --> 01:23:33.271
Tobimaru!


01:24:37.772 --> 01:24:40.104
What's wrong? Come on!


01:24:41.076 --> 01:24:43.340
I'm not feeling any pain!


01:24:44.079 --> 01:24:47.947
Try to stab that sword through my heart!


01:24:48.817 --> 01:24:50.045
Come on!!


01:24:54.522 --> 01:24:57.320
Hurry up and get back here! Kachuu's dead!


01:24:58.326 --> 01:24:59.987
I've taken care of the rest of them!


01:25:11.506 --> 01:25:12.200
Tobimaru!


01:25:19.180 --> 01:25:19.839
Let's go!


01:25:21.883 --> 01:25:24.716
The ritual's been interrupted by someone!


01:25:24.752 --> 01:25:28.449
The time has passed. 
What do you plan to do?


01:25:28.590 --> 01:25:29.818
Isn't that obvious?!


01:25:29.858 --> 01:25:30.950
We'll take back the child,


01:25:30.992 --> 01:25:33.688
And we'll wait. 
Whether it's ten or a hundred years!


01:25:33.795 --> 01:25:34.762
Leave it to me!


01:25:44.672 --> 01:25:46.037
Seriously...


01:25:46.708 --> 01:25:48.266
This isn't going to be cheap.


01:25:50.745 --> 01:25:51.939
I knew it!


01:25:52.547 --> 01:25:53.878
I heard you!


01:25:54.215 --> 01:25:56.115
You called my name, right?


01:25:58.086 --> 01:26:00.179
Damn it, you're late!


01:26:00.955 --> 01:26:03.321
I told you I had a short patience!


01:26:03.825 --> 01:26:05.315
Making me wait like that...


01:26:06.828 --> 01:26:09.228
Alright, let's go. Don't fall behind.


01:26:10.565 --> 01:26:11.532
I know.


01:26:11.633 --> 01:26:13.533
I didn't say it to you.


01:26:14.769 --> 01:26:16.464
I said it to Tobimaru.


01:26:22.010 --> 01:26:23.068
Get back!


01:26:53.608 --> 01:26:54.540
Nanashi!


01:27:22.770 --> 01:27:24.032
Where's my sword?!


01:27:26.708 --> 01:27:28.005
Where's my sword?


01:27:30.912 --> 01:27:31.776
Nanashi!


01:27:41.055 --> 01:27:42.886
Lord Rarou...


01:27:44.559 --> 01:27:45.526
My...sword...


01:27:45.827 --> 01:27:47.089
Lord....Ra...rou...


01:27:51.933 --> 01:27:54.367
To kill Suishin and Fuugo,


01:27:54.535 --> 01:27:56.059
An impressive man.


01:27:56.170 --> 01:27:57.102
Rarou!


01:27:57.839 --> 01:27:59.500
You're in the way. Move!


01:28:03.645 --> 01:28:04.441
Shit!


01:28:12.587 --> 01:28:13.918
This is the end for you!


01:28:25.466 --> 01:28:26.660
You bastard!


01:28:26.868 --> 01:28:29.063
Have you gone crazy?!!


01:28:29.170 --> 01:28:30.330
I am very sane.


01:28:30.438 --> 01:28:32.998
I am now glad I came to this country.


01:28:34.042 --> 01:28:36.977
I feel I've finally found an opponent 
who will challenge me.


01:28:39.180 --> 01:28:42.308
I thank you for taking me on this journey.


01:28:42.483 --> 01:28:43.609
You...!


01:28:43.851 --> 01:28:45.910
Bastard warrior!


01:28:52.260 --> 01:28:53.522
Rarou!


01:28:53.628 --> 01:28:57.120
Planning to trick the Emperor and 
keep the drug for yourself,


01:28:57.498 --> 01:28:59.329
You've thought this out well.


01:28:59.434 --> 01:29:03.803
You are not worthy of immortality, you warrior!


01:29:03.905 --> 01:29:08.365
The one who is worthy is a genius leader such as myself...


01:29:10.411 --> 01:29:12.345
Haven'tyou already lived plenty?


01:29:27.829 --> 01:29:29.126
What's happening?


01:29:29.263 --> 01:29:31.254
The foreigner killed his comrade.


01:29:31.699 --> 01:29:33.758
There's only...one left!


01:30:04.932 --> 01:30:06.399
We met before.


01:30:07.668 --> 01:30:08.566
Nanashi!


01:30:09.971 --> 01:30:10.801
Usethis....


01:30:12.707 --> 01:30:13.833
USE


01:30:14.308 --> 01:30:15.172
DRUG


01:30:15.576 --> 01:30:16.508
PAIN


01:30:16.711 --> 01:30:17.700
GO AWAY


01:30:23.985 --> 01:30:25.009
I don't need it.


01:30:26.988 --> 01:30:30.719
I feel like having the pain is what makes you feel alive.


01:30:34.529 --> 01:30:35.830
That's great.


01:30:35.830 --> 01:30:37.161
That's really great.


01:30:38.065 --> 01:30:41.501
I like you more and more.


01:33:54.662 --> 01:33:55.651
Nanashi!


01:34:50.251 --> 01:34:53.687
This is the first time I've ever been cut.


01:34:53.921 --> 01:34:56.481
The pain of a sword,


01:34:56.724 --> 01:35:00.558
Somehow...strange...


01:35:00.961 --> 01:35:03.122
Strange...


01:35:06.033 --> 01:35:09.992
A strange feeling...


01:36:09.497 --> 01:36:11.124
You've gotten pretty good.


01:36:11.866 --> 01:36:14.994
Somehow...It feels like walking on clouds.


01:36:15.536 --> 01:36:16.935
You don't have to flatter me.


01:36:18.038 --> 01:36:19.733
Are your wounds ok?


01:36:20.107 --> 01:36:21.005
Yeah.


01:36:21.308 --> 01:36:23.833
Even a treasure like that came in handy.


01:36:23.944 --> 01:36:24.842
See?


01:36:25.179 --> 01:36:26.009
Seriously...


01:36:26.881 --> 01:36:28.940
What a boss.


01:36:36.490 --> 01:36:38.788
Can you see the town yet?


01:36:39.393 --> 01:36:40.690
Not yet,


01:36:41.061 --> 01:36:43.552
I'm sure we're almost there!


01:36:44.765 --> 01:36:45.493
Hey...?


01:36:45.966 --> 01:36:46.591
Hey?


01:36:47.468 --> 01:36:51.029
After you get better, how about we
cross the sea and leave this country?


01:36:51.639 --> 01:36:55.666
In foreign countries there won't be anyone who
will bother you about your hair color, right?


01:36:56.544 --> 01:36:57.602
A foreign country...


01:36:58.412 --> 01:37:00.614
That doesn't sound all bad.


01:37:00.614 --> 01:37:02.013
How will we save up the money?


01:37:02.283 --> 01:37:06.379
We can be bodyguards, or thieves, or anything.


01:37:06.587 --> 01:37:08.919
We can even start a pirate crew!


01:37:09.456 --> 01:37:10.480
Man,


01:37:11.225 --> 01:37:13.853
You're just looking for trouble.


01:37:15.563 --> 01:37:16.825
I'm going to speed up a bit,


01:37:16.864 --> 01:37:18.229
Hang on tight!


01:37:20.201 --> 01:37:20.963
Alright.


01:37:26.774 --> 01:37:27.900
Let's go!

